                <img class="img-fluid" width="100%" high="100%" src="/dist/img/profile/anand_radhakrishnan.png" alt="Mr. Anand Radhakrishnan | Managing Director" aria-label="Mr. Anand Radhakrishnan Managing Director" fetchpriority="high" >
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-8 col-12">
                <h2 class="text-30 lh-15 text-sm-blue">Sundaram Asset Management Company: <span class="text-sm-orange">A Legacy of Trust and Innovation</span></h2>
                
                <div class="y-gap-5">
                    <div class="d-flex items-center mt-10">
                        
                        <h3 class="fw-400 text-dark-8 text-22"><b>A Proud Heritage</b></h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-justify text-dark-5">
                        We are a fully owned subsidiary of one of India's oldest and most respected NBFCs - Sundaram Finance Limited (SFL). Established in 1996, Sundaram Asset Management Company has been at the forefront of managing funds that cater to the diverse investment needs of investors, offering solutions tailored to varying risk, reward, and liquidity preferences.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="y-gap-5">
                    <div class="d-flex items-center mt-10">
                        
                        <h3 class="fw-400 text-dark-8 text-22"><b>Retail Savers at the Core</b></h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-justify text-dark-5">
                        True to the Sundaram brand, we place the retail saver at the heart of everything we do. Our unwavering commitment to making mutual funds accessible to everyone drives our growth and expansion. With 80+ branches across India, an office in Dubai, and a wholly owned subsidiary in Singapore, we are bringing investment opportunities closer to investors worldwide.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="y-gap-5">
                    <div class="d-flex items-center mt-10">
                        
                        <h3 class="fw-400 text-dark-8 text-22"><b>Empowering 3.5 Million Investors</b></h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-justify text-dark-5">
                        With 30 years of expertise in fund management, we have earned the trust of over 3.5 million customers. Our diverse range of products is designed to meet the unique needs of every investor, offering:
                    </p>
                    <div class="d-flex x-gap-20 y-gap-5 ml-10" role="list">
                        <div class="d-flex items-center" role="listitem">
                            <div class="d-flex items-center justify-center size-20 rounded-full bg-sm-orange mr-15">
                                <i class="text-white size-12" data-feather="check"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="fw-400">
                                <b>Equity Funds</b> for long-term growth
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="d-flex items-center" role="listitem">
                            <div class="d-flex items-center justify-center size-20 rounded-full bg-sm-orange mr-15">
                                <i class="text-white size-12" data-feather="check"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="fw-400">
                                <b>Fixed-Income Funds</b> for stability and liquidity
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="d-flex items-center" role="listitem">
                            <div class="d-flex items-center justify-center size-20 rounded-full bg-sm-orange mr-15">
                                <i class="text-white size-12" data-feather="check"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="fw-400">
                                <b>Hybrid Funds</b> for a balanced approach to growth and stability
                            </div>
                        </div> 
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-justify text-dark-5">
                        At the core of our success is a <b>strong research team and robust processes,</b> ensuring consistent performance and reliability.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="y-gap-5">
                    <div class="d-flex items-center mt-10">
                        
                        <h3 class="fw-400 text-dark-8 text-22"><b>Unearthing Opportunities, Delivering Excellence</b></h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-justify text-dark-5">
                        With Rs. 85,000 crores in Assets Under Management, we are pioneers in identifying and capitalizing on emerging investment themes. We were the first to launch funds in innovative areas such as:
                    </p>
                    <div class="d-flex x-gap-20 y-gap-5 ml-10" role="list">
                        <div class="d-flex items-center" role="listitem">
                            <div class="d-flex items-center justify-center size-20 rounded-full bg-sm-orange mr-15">
                                <i class="text-white size-12" data-feather="check"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="fw-400">
                                <b>Mid-Caps</b>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="d-flex items-center" role="listitem">
                            <div class="d-flex items-center justify-center size-20 rounded-full bg-sm-orange mr-15">
                                <i class="text-white size-12" data-feather="check"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="fw-400">
                                <b>Business Cycle</b>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="d-flex items-center" role="listitem">
                            <div class="d-flex items-center justify-center size-20 rounded-full bg-sm-orange mr-15">
                                <i class="text-white size-12" data-feather="check"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="fw-400">
                                <b>Services</b>
                            </div>
                        </div> 
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="y-gap-5">
                    <div class="d-flex items-center mt-10">
                        
                        <h3 class="fw-400 text-dark-8 text-22"><b>Our Commitment to Excellence</b></h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-justify text-dark-5">
                        We are dedicated to enhancing value for stakeholders while upholding the highest standards of ethics. With a focus on innovation, trust, and performance, we continue to lead the way in unearthing opportunities and delivering financial success.
